      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Modred, dark sorcerer of Wundagore, and the possessed Scarlet Witch, attack the Avengers as they crash-land in Transia. The Witch of Wundagore holds her teammates captive, but her dark magic is no match for her mighty teammates!"
    },
